---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Welcome to Riley's Terminal!</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to my homepage, girlboss! I'm Riley, your resident project creator. 
				If you need me, I'll be in the <a href="/about">About</a> page, 
				If you're here to listen to my ramblings about my personal life, that'll be in my <a href="/blog">blog</a>, and if you are here to 
				peek at the projects under the hood, check out the <a href="/ProjLog">ProjLog</a>, my latest project inception. 
			</p>
			<p>
				If you want to contribute to the list of projects or were inspired to create your own through my lists, please reach out to me so I can
				thank you personally. I'm always supportive of creators who want to create, but can't find a project to start on. If you need more specific 
				information on any details listed out, also reach out. I love meeting new people, especially fellow creators!!
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
